{"id":"415270","name":"三鲜汤","author":"美女天天","authorId":"6241101","desc":"","cover":"images/415270/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"娃娃菜","amount":"50g"},{"name":"白玉菇","amount":"50g"},{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"1个"}],"sub":[{"name":"水淀粉","amount":"2g"},{"name":"盐","amount":"2g"},{"name":"胡椒粉","amount":"少许"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"食材备好。","img":"images/415270/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"鸡蛋磕入碗里加适量水淀粉。","img":"images/415270/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"把蛋液搅匀。","img":"images/415270/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"平底锅烧热倒油。","img":"images/415270/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"倒入蛋液摊成鸡蛋饼。","img":"images/415270/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"鸡蛋饼切成条。","img":"images/415270/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"白菜切丝。","img":"images/415270/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"锅里加入适量水烧开，加点盐。","img":"images/415270/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"淋入少许油。","img":"images/415270/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"放入白菜帮先煮开。","img":"images/415270/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"加入洗好的白玉菇烧开。","img":"images/415270/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"加入白菜叶接着煮开。","img":"images/415270/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"最后加入鸡蛋饼丝煮开。","img":"images/415270/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"撒点白胡椒粉。","img":"images/415270/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"加上少许生抽，也可以不加的。","img":"images/415270/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"淋上香油美味即成。","img":"images/415270/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"美味的汤。","img":"images/415270/step_17.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：汤锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}